			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2407647">
									

<p>This was a weird read for me. Not because of the SCP itself, but because while reading I kept changing between &quot;this sounds interesting&quot; and &quot;oh this sounds dumb&quot;. Sadly it ended with the latter. The idea of there being small cognitohazards in Hollywood movies sounded interesting, but the effects themselves were really boring. The movie with living toys makes people believe they are toys. The movie about migratory birds makes people want to migrate. And so on. The effects were really easy to guess after the first one and were really dull, which is not a good thing since the SCP doesn't have anything else going for it.</p>

