			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2408012">
									

<p>I was hoping you would touch on the Motion Picture Association film rating system as a covert means to monitor. It would be interesting to figure why indie films get little assistance with adapting their film to the MPAA standard, while the big Hollywood films get bullet points on what they ought to change to get the desirable rating (usually PG-13).</p>
